&lt;p&gt;Moving to a new area means figuring out healthcare from scratch. You need a primary care doctor, maybe a specialist, and you need to know where to go when things go wrong. Here&amp;rsquo;s what&amp;rsquo;s known about navigating healthcare in Anne Arundel County.&lt;/p&gt;

