&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Anne Arundel Medical Center
 &lt;div id="anne-arundel-medical-center" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#anne-arundel-medical-center" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main hospital for the county is Anne Arundel Medical Center (AAMC) in Annapolis. It&amp;rsquo;s a 507-bed acute care hospital with emergency services, maternity care, cardiac care, and a full range of medical services.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tricare Health Insurance for Military Families</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/tricare-guide/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/tricare-guide/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;Tricare Health Insurance for Military Families
